# game/week3.rpy:19
translate indonesian week3_start_4fc59a8d:

    # modelling_teacher "The finished product will consist of a sword, shield, barrel, wooden box, and sack."
    modelling_teacher  "Hasil jadinya nanti terdiri dari pedang, perisai, tong barel, peti kayu, dan karung goni."

# game/week3.rpy:21
translate indonesian week3_start_1c4bc0ea:

    # n "Some students begin to retreat to their own computers, not waiting to complete the task."
    n  "Beberapa siswa mulai kembali ke komputer masing-masing, tak sabar ingin segera menyelesaikan tugas itu."

# game/week3.rpy:22
translate indonesian week3_start_b62eb812:

    # n "You roll back to your desk and open Maya on your computer once again."
    n  "Kamu mendorong kursimu kembali ke mejamu dan membuka kembali aplikasi Maya di komputermu."

# game/week3.rpy:24
translate indonesian week3_start_395d1fd8:

    # modelling_teacher "Once you’re done, upload the Maya ASCII file to the server, and don’t forget to name your files correctly…"
    modelling_teacher  "Kalau sudah selesai, unggah file Maya ASCII ke server, dan jangan lupa format penamaan filenya yang benar…"

# game/week3.rpy:26
translate indonesian week3_start_095545f8:

    # n "For a moment, amid the week’s assignments, you think you might be starting to understand this material a bit better."
