# game/week3.rpy:27
translate indonesian week3_start_0793518d:

    # n "However, the most frustrating part of modelling remains UV unwrapping. Creating a seamless texture requires immense patience."
    n  "Namun, bagian paling menjengkelkan dari modelling 3D tetaplah UV unwrapping. Menyusun tekstur yang rapi tanpa celah butuh kesabaran ekstra besar."

# game/week3.rpy:29
translate indonesian week3_start_fb55baff:

    # n "Your fingers tense on the 'W', 'E', and 'R' keys, with your pinky pressing 'Alt'."
    n  "Jemarimu tegang bertengger di tombol 'W', 'E', dan 'R', dengan kelingking menekan tombol 'Alt'."

# game/week3.rpy:30
translate indonesian week3_start_4353bd55:

    # n "Frustration builds as you click and drag the mouse aggressively, your brows knit tightly."
