    # n "You sink back into the familiar chair, feeling its comforting weight cradle your body and anchor you in place."
    n  "Kamu menyandarkan punggungmu ke kursi yang nyaman, merasakan bebannya menopang tubuhmu dengan pas."

# game/week3.rpy:123
