    # julia "…Yeah. I mean—yeah. A little."
    julia  "…Iya. Maksudku—iya, lumayan suka."

# game/week3.rpy:461
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_b767ba1d:

    # n "She shifts her weight, angling her body toward yours. Her grip on the camera lens relaxes as her fingers trace the edge of the frame."
    n  "Ia menggeser posisi duduknya, mengarahkan tubuhnya lebih menghadap ke arahmu. Cengkeraman tangannya pada lensa kamera perlahan mengendur."

# game/week3.rpy:462
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_d049cdce:

    # julia "I just like capturing… the quiet stuff. The small things that people usually walk right past without seeing."
    julia  "Aku cuma suka memotret… hal-hal yang hening. Hal-hal kecil yang biasanya dilewatin orang begitu aja pas lagi jalan."

# game/week3.rpy:463
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_d5b6658f:

    # n "She holds your gaze for a beat longer than usual, then suddenly blinks, her eyes dropping back to the floor as she realises how much she just shared."
    n  "Ia menatap matamu sedikit lebih lama dari biasanya, lalu mendadak mengerjap, pandangannya beralih menatap lantai semen."

# game/week3.rpy:465
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_41ddd926:

    # julia "…Sorry. Was that a bit too much? I’m probably rambling."
    julia  "…Maaf ya. Tadi omonganku agak aneh ya? Aku kayaknya malah ngelantur sendiri."

# game/week3.rpy:467
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_00ba6b8b:

    # p "No. It’s fine."
    p  "Nggak kok. Bagus banget malahan."

# game/week3.rpy:468
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_8eb0eb77:

    # n "Julia stills for a moment, looking at you longer than necessary, as if she’s checking to see if you’re being polite."
    n  "Julia mematung sesaat, menatapmu cukup lama seolah sedang memastikan apakah kamu bersungguh-sungguh dengan ucapanmu."

# game/week3.rpy:469
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_9b069913:

    # n "When she realises you’re sincere, her grip on the camera finally relaxes."
    n  "Begitu menyadari ketulusanmu, cengkeraman tangannya pada kamera akhirnya benar-benar rileks."

# game/week3.rpy:470
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_3335ebd2:

    # n "The rigid line of her shoulders drops, and she exhales a breath she’s been holding since the conversation started."
    n  "Garis kaku di pundaknya meluruh, dan ia menghembuskan napas yang sempat tertahan sejak tadi."

# game/week3.rpy:471
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_584d7a42:

    # n "The wind sweeps between you, carrying the distant sounds of campus life, but here, it’s quiet."
    n  "Semilir angin berhembus di antara kalian berdua, membawa suara sayup kehidupan sekolah di kejauhan, namun di sini terasa begitu damai."

# game/week3.rpy:473
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_337939b5:

    # julia "Do you want to see one?"
    julia  "Kamu mau lihat salah satu fotonya?"

# game/week3.rpy:474
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_1bf0cdfe:

    # n "She lifts the camera, tilting the small, glowing LCD screen toward you."
    n  "Ia mengangkat kameranya, memiringkan layar LCD mungil yang menyala ke arahmu."

# game/week3.rpy:475
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_4cb36812:

    # n "You step closer—close enough to catch the faint scent of her shampoo and hear the mechanical hum of the camera."
    n  "Kamu melangkah mendekat—cukup dekat hingga bisa mencium aroma lembut sampo di rambutnya dan mendengar bunyi klik halus tombol kamera."

# game/week3.rpy:476
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_c4386481:

    # n "On the display, the image is sharp and honest."
    n  "Di layar kecil itu, fotonya tampak begitu tajam, bercerita, dan apa adanya."

# game/week3.rpy:477
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_1ae147f3:

    # n "It’s a shot of students on the lawn below. One student is mid-laugh, head thrown back, while another points at something out of frame. It’s messy, but it feels like it’s alive."
    n  "Itu adalah potret para siswa di lapangan rumput bawah. Seorang siswa tertangkap kamera sedang tertawa lepas mendongak ke langit, sementara temannya berusaha menyeimbangkan cup minuman."

# game/week3.rpy:479
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_e9b3de11:

    # julia "I just… like moments like this."
    julia  "Aku cuma… suka momen-momen spontan kayak gini."

# game/week3.rpy:480
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_907e27f8:

    # n "Julia glances at you with a quick, searching look to see if you understand, then her eyes dart back to the safety of the viewfinder."
    n  "Julia melirik sekilas ke arahmu untuk melihat apakah kamu memahami maksudnya, lalu kembali menatap layar kameranya."

# game/week3.rpy:481
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_9176280d:

    # julia "When people forget they’re being watched, that’s when they are actually themselves."
    julia  "Waktu orang-orang lupa kalau mereka lagi dilihat, di saat itulah mereka bener-bener jadi diri mereka sendiri."

# game/week3.rpy:485
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_9518d02a:

    # p "That’s… really nice."
    p  "Fotonya… bagus banget, beneran."

# game/week3.rpy:488
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_aaf6f4a4:

    # p "You notice a lot, huh?"
    p  "Kamu tipe pengamat yang jeli banget ya."

# game/week3.rpy:491
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_05ddd783:

    # n "Julia lowers the camera with a slow, deliberate motion."
    n  "Julia menurunkan kameranya dengan gerakan perlahan dan hati-hati."

# game/week3.rpy:492
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_5ef0a2fe:

    # n "Her fingers linger on the casing for a moment too long, as if she’s trying to imprint the memory of the silence into the plastic."
    n  "Jemarinya sempat berdiam di bodi kamera, seolah sedang merekam momen apresiasi barusan ke dalam ingatannya."

# game/week3.rpy:493
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_3f4eb38c:

    # n "The faint smile on her face is still there—fragile and small, yet the most genuine thing you’ve seen all day."
    n  "Senyum tipis di wajahnya masih bertahan—rapuh dan lembut, namun merupakan senyum paling tulus yang pernah kamu lihat darinya."

# game/week3.rpy:494
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_8b58eb34:

    # n "The silence that follows isn’t heavy or oppressive; it’s a shared breath."
    n  "Keheningan yang tercipta setelahnya sama sekali tidak terasa canggung; itu adalah keheningan yang saling memahami."

# game/week3.rpy:495
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_5446708d:

    # n "For a moment, the rest of the world becomes mere background noise."
    n  "Untuk sesaat, dunia di luar sana hanyalah suara latar yang tak penting."

# game/week3.rpy:497
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_d8cb0bec:

    # n "Then, the distant toll of the campus bell cuts through the air."
    n  "Lalu, dentang lonceng sekolah di kejauhan membelah udara."

# game/week3.rpy:498
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_87a83649:

    # n "The sound drifts up to the balcony, sharp and rhythmic, snapping the connection to the peaceful moment."
    n  "Suaranya merambat naik ke balkon, tajam dan berirama, membuyarkan sejenak koneksi sunyi yang baru saja terjalin."

# game/week3.rpy:499
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_89cb68b9:

    # n "Below, clusters of students that had been frozen in place break apart, flowing toward their next classes like a disturbed anthill. The stillness is gone."
    n  "Di bawah sana, gerombolan siswa yang tadinya santai mulai bubar, bergegas melangkah kembali ke gedung kelas masing-masing."

# game/week3.rpy:501
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_e407db42:

    # n "Julia adjusts the strap on her shoulder, the leather creaking slightly in the wind. She shifts her weight, the reality of her schedule settling back in."
    n  "Julia merapikan tali kamera di pundaknya, gesekan kulit talinya berderit pelan diterpa angin."

# game/week3.rpy:502
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_56d1a933:

    # julia "We should probably head back."
    julia  "Kayaknya kita harus balik ke kelas deh."

# game/week3.rpy:503
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_cb018e99:

    # n "She hesitates, her gaze flickering to yours one last time, as if acknowledging the secret you just shared."
    n  "Ia sempat ragu, tatapannya beralih menatap matamu sekali lagi, seolah mengakui kehangatan momen singkat barusan."

# game/week3.rpy:505
translate indonesian week3_lounge_julia_818b4925:

    # n "With a small, decisive nod, she turns toward the heavy metal door. You follow a step behind as the door swings open."
    n  "Dengan anggukan kecil yang mantap, ia berbalik menuju pintu besi yang berat. Kamu mengikutinya beberapa langkah di belakang."

# game/week3.rpy:514
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_66ca79db:

    # n "The 3D lab empties gradually—the low hum of rolling chairs, the rhythmic thud of the heavy exit door, and finally, a profound silence except for one corner."
    n  "Lab 3D perlahan mulai lengang—derit pelan kursi beroda, bunyi langkah kaki yang melangkah pergi, dan sapaan pamit yang menggema di lorong."

# game/week3.rpy:515
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_b40c0f12:

    # n "A single monitor casts a sharp, clinical blue glow over Trida."
    n  "Hanya tersisa satu monitor yang membiaskan cahaya biru tajam ke arah sosok Trida."

# game/week3.rpy:516
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_8ade67e1:

    # n "They are hunched forward, shoulders raised to their ears, their noses inches from the screen as if trying to merge with the pixels."
    n  "Ia duduk membungkuk ke depan, pundaknya terangkat tegang hingga ke telinga, ujung hidungnya nyaris menempel ke layar."

# game/week3.rpy:518
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_1d4baf8f:

    # trida "No, no, that’s not right… Why is it stretching? Just—stay. Stay!"
    trida  "Nggak, nggak, bukan gitu caranya… Kenapa mesh-nya malah melar sih? Ayo dong—jangan geser. Diem di situ!"

# game/week3.rpy:519
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_c3fefb2c:

    # n "*Click. Ctrl+Z. Click. Ctrl+Z.*"
    n  "*Klik. Ctrl+Z. Klik. Ctrl+Z.*"

# game/week3.rpy:520
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_eb8fd91f:

    # n "The mechanical keyboard clacks like rapid gunfire. You step into the pool of blue light."
    n  "Suara tuts keyboard mekanik berderak cepat laksana rentetan senapan. Kamu melangkah masuk ke dalam genangan pendar biru itu."

# game/week3.rpy:522
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_e50c917f:

    # p "...You’re still here?"
    p  "...Kamu masih di sini?"

# game/week3.rpy:524
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_cdfdf2dd:

    # n "Trida jolts, their chair screeching harshly against the floor. They whip around, blinking rapidly as they adjust to your presence."
    n  "Trida terlonjak kaget, kursi kayunya berderit keras menggores lantai. Ia berputar cepat, matanya membelalak panik sebelum mendapati dirimu."

# game/week3.rpy:525
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_ecaabbfe:

    # n "A practised, weary smile quickly masks their frustration."
    n  "Senyum letih yang dipaksakan buru-buru menutupi rasa frustrasinya."

# game/week3.rpy:527
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_096caa76:

    # trida "Oh! Hey. You scared me for a second."
    trida  "Oh! Hei. Bikin kaget aja kamu mah."

# game/week3.rpy:529
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_87f86987:

    # n "They straighten up, smoothing their uniform with a shaky hand."
    n  "Ia menegakkan duduknya, merapikan seragamnya dengan tangan yang sedikit gemetar."

# game/week3.rpy:530
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_63bec4a7:

    # trida "Yeah, I just… found a tiny hiccup. One more fix and I’m out. Ten minutes, tops."
    trida  "Iya nih, aku cuma… nemu sedikit kendala kecil. Satu sentuhan lagi kelar kok, terus aku langsung pulang. Paling sepuluh menit doang."

# game/week3.rpy:531
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_8326bd95:

    # n "Trida’s eyes are bloodshot, and the scroll bar on their screen is barely a quarter of the way down. They aren't leaving anytime soon."
    n  "Mata Trida tampak memerah kelelahan, dan bilah scroll di layarnya bahkan baru terisi seperempatnya."

# game/week3.rpy:535
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_6e96aff1:

    # p "You should eat first."
    p  "Kamu mending makan dulu deh."

# game/week3.rpy:537
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_cd4625f0:

    # p "If you keep going, you’re gonna pass out at your desk."
    p  "Kalau kamu paksain terus, kamu bisa pingsan di meja lho."

# game/week3.rpy:539
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_5ba826a3:

    # p "Let’s take a break. You’ve done enough."
    p  "Yuk istirahat dulu. Kamu udah kerja keras banget hari ini."

# game/week3.rpy:542
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_ece67998:

    # n "Trida slams their mouse down with a decisive thud, the sound slicing through the room's silence like a sharp knife."
    n  "Trida menghempaskan mouse-nya ke meja dengan bunyi debuk mantap, membelah keheningan lab."

# game/week3.rpy:543
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_02dbe9e1:

    # n "There’s an unmistakable finality in the action, with nothing but a lingering pause, even the attempt to save any files or salvage any work didn’t occur to them—just a resolute gesture, an emphatic declaration that this chapter is thoroughly closed."
    n  "Tampak rasa lega yang tak terbantahkan dari tindakannya itu, menyisakan helaan napas panjang yang melepas penat."

# game/week3.rpy:546
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_0ded6425:

    # trida "Yeah, break sounds good."
    trida  "Iya juga ya, kayaknya istirahat emang ide bagus."

# game/week3.rpy:547
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_43db80a1:

    # n "With a swift and graceful motion, they send their bag tumbling from the edge of the table, the contents shifting and clattering as it falls."
    n  "Dengan gerakan sigap, tas punggungnya hampir saja merosot jatuh dari tepi meja."

# game/week3.rpy:548
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_e4029903:

    # n "Just in time, they snatch the strap from the air, preventing it from landing with a thud on the floor."
    n  "Tepat pada waktunya, tangannya menyambar tali tas itu di udara, menyelamatkannya sebelum menghantam lantai."

# game/week3.rpy:549
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_f8cd5248:

    # n "In one seamless movement, they rise from their seat, poised in that electrifying moment between the comfort of sitting and the urgency of sprinting."
    n  "Dalam satu gerakan luwes, ia bangkit dari kursinya, kembali memancarkan pesona enerjik yang ceria."

# game/week3.rpy:550
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_b2111083:

    # n "A small, conspiratorial grin tugs at their mouth as they glance back at you."
    n  "Senyum jahil yang penuh keakraban terukir di bibirnya saat ia menoleh menatapmu."

# game/week3.rpy:552
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_82d7a066:

    # trida "You’re coming too, right?"
    trida  "Kamu ikut juga kan pastinya?"

# game/week3.rpy:553
translate indonesian week3_lab_trida_aa4b2ca1:

    # p "Of course!"
    p  "Pasti dong!"

# game/week3.rpy:567
translate indonesian week3_second_break_f347cab5:

    # n "After the sixth period, there will be a second breaktime for students."
    n  "Setelah jam pelajaran keenam selesai, biasanya ada jam istirahat kedua untuk para siswa."

# game/week3.rpy:568
translate indonesian week3_second_break_1fe5c108:

    # n "Some of them stick out with their groups, some of them go to the canteen, and the others probably grind their work."
    n  "Beberapa siswa berkumpul santai dengan gengnya, sebagian melipir ke kantin, dan sisanya memilih nongkrong di lorong."

# game/week3.rpy:569
translate indonesian week3_second_break_98df6d0b:

    # n "You see that your task has already been done, and now you have to think. Should you just wander around and try to socialize?"
    n  "Kamu melihat tugasmu hari ini sudah tuntas, dan sekarang kamu menimbang-nimbang langkah berikutnya."

# game/week3.rpy:582
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_d0d097ac:

    # n "The clock is ticking faster than a blink of an eye, after the break time your body has to drag yourself back to the studio."
    n  "Waktu berdetik lebih cepat dari kedipan mata, dan usai jam istirahat tubuhmu bersiap melangkah kembali."

# game/week3.rpy:583
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_a2f42766:

    # n "You step yourself moving from the door when suddenly, you stumble across a very familiar figure now locking their eyes on you."
    n  "Kamu baru saja melangkah keluar pintu saat tiba-tiba berpapasan dengan sosok yang sangat familier."

# game/week3.rpy:584
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_915f2f73:

    # n "The bright gleaming eyes that waved their hands vigorously."
    n  "Sepasang mata berbinar cerah menyapamu seraya melambaikan tangannya penuh semangat."

# game/week3.rpy:587
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_f79b27db:

    # chie "Hey [player_name]!"
    chie  "Hei [player_name]!"

# game/week3.rpy:588
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_7b003daa:

    # chie "Going back to class?"
    chie  "Mau balik ke kelas ya?"

# game/week3.rpy:589
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_330d0319:

    # n "The sound of Chie giggling waving through your ears. You stunned for a moment, before opening your lips."
    n  "Suara tawa renyah Chie menggelitik telingamu. Kamu terpaku sejenak, lalu membalas sapanya."

# game/week3.rpy:591
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_7b4dadce:

    # p "Yeah, kind of. Are you still at work?"
    p  "Iya nih, kurang lebih gitu. Kamu masih lanjut ngerjain tugas magang?"

# game/week3.rpy:593
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_66ccaab8:

    # n "Chie looks making a sound of tired laughter hearing that. She tucked her hair to her ears."
    n  "Chie tertawa kecil terdengar agak letih mendengarnya. Ia menyelipkan helai rambut ke belakang telinganya."

# game/week3.rpy:594
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_fabf4ce9:

    # n "There is a nervous gesture she kind of pushes to the air. She makes a vague, restless gesture in the air."
    n  "Gerak tubuhnya menyiratkan sedikit rasa canggung yang tertahan. Senyum tipis nan pasrah tersungging di bibirnya."

# game/week3.rpy:595
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_088c05f7:

    # chie "Well, I don't wanna look like I'm whining about my work. But you know the deadlines are ruthless.."
    chie  "Yah, aku nggak mau kelihatan kayak tukang ngeluh sih. Tapi kamu tahu sendiri kan gimana kejamnya deadline proyek animasi…"

# game/week3.rpy:599
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_6db6a7a3:

    # p "You look like you're about to collapse. Sit for a second."
    p  "Muka kamu kelihatan capek banget kayak mau tumbang. Duduk dulu gih bentar."

# game/week3.rpy:601
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_db724586:

    # p "You’ve been pushing yourself too hard. It’s okay to take a break."
    p  "Kamu udah terlalu memaksakan diri lho. Nggak ada salahnya istirahat sebentar."

# game/week3.rpy:604
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_cd98fa85:

    # chie "Ah.. it’s alright! It’s just been rough just these past week"
    chie  "Ah… nggak apa-apa kok! Cuma emang minggu ini jadwalnya lagi padat-padatnya aja."

# game/week3.rpy:605
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_75d6a5e3:

    # n "Chie’s shoulders drop, the tension finally leaving her frame."
    n  "Pundak Chie perlahan mengendur, ketegangan akhirnya luruh dari tubuhnya."

# game/week3.rpy:606
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_58310217:

    # n "She lets out a long, shaky exhale, and for the first time, her gaze meets you without that forced, bright mask."
    n  "Ia menghembuskan napas panjang yang sedikit bergetar, dan untuk pertama kalinya, tatapannya bertemu dengan tatapanmu penuh rasa terima kasih."

# game/week3.rpy:607
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_2357cb1e:

    # chie "But, I really appreciate that"
    chie  "Tapi, aku bener-bener berterima kasih banget atas perhatianmu ya."

# game/week3.rpy:608
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_3cb66d3b:

    # chie "You can message me anytime too you know, if you had any problem"
    chie  "Kamu juga boleh chat aku kapan aja kok kalau lagi ada kendala materi atau apa pun."

# game/week3.rpy:611
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_6f2b3488:

    # n "You nod, as she patted your shoulder then moved back to the studio leaving you tracking her back moving."
    n  "Kamu mengangguk mantap saat ia menepuk ramah pundakmu, lalu berbalik melangkah kembali ke studio meninggalkanmu yang tersenyum lega."

# game/week3.rpy:612
translate indonesian week3_chie_encounter_bd21821c:

    # n "Hopefully you two met again, maybe during something more fun than a deadline stacking for both of you."
    n  "Semoga lain kali kalian bisa mengobrol santai dalam suasana yang lebih menyenangkan daripada sekadar buru-buru dikejar tenggat waktu."

# game/week3.rpy:626
translate indonesian week3_bedroom_night_8d06691f:

    # n "Finally, after a click, the sound of your keys turning, and the smell of your room swarming through your nose."
    n  "Akhirnya, setelah bunyi 'klik' kunci pintu kamarmu berputar dan aroma kamarmu menyambutmu pulang."

# game/week3.rpy:627
translate indonesian week3_bedroom_night_b7df65fe:

    # n "The tension and the weight in your body leave your skin entirely. Your hand reaching the bed felt warmer than ever."
    n  "Segala ketegangan dan beban di tubuhmu luruh sepenuhnya dari pundakmu. Tanganmu menjatuhkan tas sekolah ke lantai."

# game/week3.rpy:628
translate indonesian week3_bedroom_night_af8a95be:

    # n "As your mind replayed today's lecture and all your thoughts started to drift away, in the place called the dream world."
    n  "Saat ingatanmu memutar kembali pelajaran dan perjumpaan hari ini, perlahan pikiranmu mulai melayang hanyut ke alam mimpi..."

translate indonesian strings:

    # game/week3.rpy:47
    old "Ask Trida for help"
    new "Minta bantuan ke Trida"

